# ⚖️ 6. WEIGHTED RNG

Most Aetheria systems use **Weighted RNG**.

Example:

```text
COMMON       70%
UNCOMMON     20%
RARE          8%
EPIC          1.8%
LEGENDARY     0.2%
```

The system calculates a random result based on the configured weight.

