# 👑 8. RECRUITMENT RNG

The Recruit System contains four recruitment methods.

```text
RECRUIT SYSTEM
│
├── Gold Recruit
├── Ticket Recruit
├── Gem Recruit
└── Special Ticket Recruit
```

Each method uses a different RNG configuration.

---

# 🪙 9. GOLD RECRUIT

Gold Recruit uses:

```text
⭐ 1
⭐⭐ 2
⭐⭐⭐ 3
```

Star 3 has a very low probability.

Example configuration:

```text
⭐      79.0%
⭐⭐     20.0%
⭐⭐⭐     1.0%
```

The exact probability can be adjusted later through configuration.

Important:

> **Gold Recruit can never produce Star 4 or Star 5.**

Flow:

```text
MASTER
  ↓
GOLD RECRUIT
  ↓
RNG
  ↓
STAR 1–3
  ↓
CHARACTER POOL
  ↓
AI SELECTION
  ↓
DUPLICATE CHECK
  ↓
CHARACTER
```

---

# 🎟️ 10. TICKET RECRUIT

Ticket Recruit uses:

```text
⭐⭐ 2
⭐⭐⭐ 3
⭐⭐⭐⭐ 4
```

Star 4 has a very low probability.

Example:

```text
⭐⭐       74%
⭐⭐⭐      24%
⭐⭐⭐⭐      2%
```

Important:

> **Ticket Recruit cannot produce Star 1 or Star 5.**

Flow:

```text
TICKET
  ↓
RNG
  ↓
STAR 2–4
  ↓
CHARACTER POOL
  ↓
AI SELECTION
  ↓
DUPLICATE CHECK
  ↓
CHARACTER
```

