# 💎 11. GEM RECRUIT

Gem Recruit uses:

```text
⭐ 1
⭐⭐ 2
⭐⭐⭐ 3
⭐⭐⭐⭐ 4
```

Star 4 has a low probability.

Example:

```text
⭐        50%
⭐⭐       30%
⭐⭐⭐      18%
⭐⭐⭐⭐      2%
```

Important:

> **Gem Recruit cannot produce Star 5.**

