# 🎫 12. SPECIAL TICKET RECRUIT

Special Ticket Recruit guarantees:

```text
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
```

There is no Star RNG.

```text
SPECIAL TICKET
      ↓
GUARANTEED
      ↓
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
      ↓
CHARACTER POOL
      ↓
AI SELECTION
      ↓
DUPLICATE CHECK
      ↓
CHARACTER
```

The Special Ticket Recruit therefore functions as:

> **Guaranteed Star 5 Recruitment.**

