# 📊 13. RECRUITMENT TABLE

| Recruitment     | Currency       | Star Range | Special Rule      |
| --------------- | -------------- | ---------: | ----------------- |
| Gold Recruit    | Gold           |      ⭐ 1–3 | Star 3 very rare  |
| Ticket Recruit  | Ticket         |     ⭐⭐ 2–4 | Star 4 very rare  |
| Gem Recruit     | Gem            |      ⭐ 1–4 | Star 4 very rare  |
| Special Recruit | Special Ticket |      ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Star 5 guaranteed |

These probabilities should be stored as configuration data rather than hard-coded into the RNG engine.

