# 🤖 14. AI RECRUITMENT SYSTEM

Character recruitment uses an AI-assisted selection layer.

The RNG System determines:

```text
STAR
```

The AI Recruitment System determines:

```text
WHICH AVAILABLE CHARACTER
```

Example:

```text
GOLD RECRUIT
      ↓
RNG
      ↓
⭐⭐⭐
      ↓
AI RECRUITMENT
      ↓
Available Star 3 Characters
      ↓
