# 🚫 15. NO DUPLICATE CHARACTER

Aetheria recruitment does not allow duplicate Heroes.

If:

```text
CHAR_000125
```

already belongs to the Master, the same character cannot be recruited again.

The system checks:

```text
Recruitment Result
        ↓
Character ID
        ↓
Database
        ↓
Already Owned?
```

If:

```text
YES
```

the character is removed from the available recruitment pool.

---

# 🔍 16. DUPLICATE CHECK FLOW

```text
             RNG
              │
              ▼
         STAR RESULT
              │
              ▼
       CHARACTER POOL
              │
              ▼
         AI SELECTOR
              │
              ▼
       DUPLICATE CHECK
          ┌───┴───┐
          │       │
         YES      NO
          │       │
          ▼       ▼
