# 🧠 17. AI SELECTION PRIORITY

The AI recruitment layer can evaluate:

```text
Star
Character Availability
Character Ownership
Recruitment Method
Character Pool
Faction
Race
Class
Current Master Roster
```

The AI should **not violate the configured recruitment rules**.

For example:

```text
Gold Recruit
```

cannot select:

```text
Star 4
```

even if the AI considers that character desirable.

The RNG configuration remains the authority for Star eligibility.

