# ⚠️ 19. EMPTY POOL HANDLING

A recruitment Star tier may eventually have no available characters.

Example:

```text
Star 3 Pool:
EMPTY
```

The system must not generate an invalid character.

Possible handling:

```text
Option A
Re-roll Star

Option B
Use another valid character pool

Option C
Convert to alternative reward

Option D
Return recruitment error
```

The final behavior should be defined by the Recruit System configuration.

Recommended:

> **Re-roll within valid recruitment conditions.**

