# 🎲 20. RNG SEED

The RNG engine should support a seed system.

Example:

```text
RNG Seed
123456789
```

A seed allows developers to reproduce a random sequence for testing.

This is useful for:

```text
Debugging
Testing
Replay
Simulation
Balance Testing
```

