# 🔐 21. SERVER / AUTHORITATIVE RNG

For a persistent game, important RNG results should be generated by an authoritative game layer.

Recommended:

```text
PLAYER
  ↓
GAME SERVER / AUTHORITATIVE SYSTEM
  ↓
RNG SYSTEM
  ↓
RESULT
```

The client should not determine its own recruitment result.

This helps prevent:

```text
Manipulation
Save Editing
RNG Abuse
Duplicate Generation
Invalid Rewards
```

