# 🎲 32. PITY SYSTEM

The RNG System can support a future **Pity System**.

Pity means the probability can change after repeated unsuccessful attempts.

Example:

```text
Recruit 1
No Star 4

Recruit 2
No Star 4

Recruit 3
No Star 4

...

Pity Counter
     ↓
Probability Increase
```

However:

> **Pity should be configured by the Recruit System, not hard-coded into the RNG engine.**

