```

### RNGManager

Coordinates RNG requests.

### RNGEngine

Core random generation engine.

### WeightedRandom

Handles weighted probability.

### RangeRandom

Handles numeric ranges.

### PoolRandom

Selects objects from pools.

### GuaranteedRandom

Handles guaranteed results.

### ConditionalRandom

Handles state-dependent probabilities.

### RNGSeedManager

Manages reproducible seeds.

### ProbabilityValidator

Validates probability configurations.

### RNGLogger

Records important RNG results.

### RNGConfiguration

Stores adjustable probability settings.

