# ✨ 56. FINAL PRINCIPLE

Aetheria uses RNG to create uncertainty without sacrificing system control.

```text
RNG
 ↓
Probability
 ↓
Result
 ↓
System Validation
 ↓
Game State
 ↓
Database
```

For recruitment:

```text
RESOURCE
   ↓
RECRUIT METHOD
   ↓
RNG STAR
   ↓
AI CHARACTER SELECTION
   ↓
NO DUPLICATE CHECK
   ↓
CHARACTER ID
   ↓
GAME STATE
   ↓
DATABASE
```

The four recruitment methods are:

```text
🪙 GOLD
⭐ 1–3

🎟️ TICKET
⭐⭐ 2–4

💎 GEM
⭐ 1–4

🎫 SPECIAL TICKET
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 5 GUARANTEED
```

> **RNG creates the uncertainty.**
>
> **AI selects from valid possibilities.**
>
> **Game State applies the result.**
>
> **ID identifies the entity.**
>
> **Database remembers the outcome.**

This makes the RNG System a reusable foundation for **Recruitment, Loot, Floor Rewards, Quest Rewards, and future Aetheria world events** without coupling randomness directly to any individual gameplay system.
